Chapter: BvtNavigators
  cites Uoaix chapter BritainShops
  cites Uoaix chapter GameNavigation
  cites Uoaix chapter BvtCheck

 UOAIX-53: the tinker (shop 6) sells the sextant (0x1057; rundir tinker.frg, ServUO SBTinker) and the spyglass (0x14F5;
 ServUO DefTinkering) as tools (item 42) told apart by art, the art each use reads (GameNavigation). A tinker founded
 alone holds a lot of each; the second sextant art (0x1058) is listed nowhere, so no lot holds it.
  bvt-navigators : Integer -> [Console] Integer
  bvt-navigators (unused) = when gs-new 0
    is Err (e) -> bvt-check ("navigators fixture shard: " & e) False
    is Ok (shard) -> when bb-economy 0
      is Err (e) -> bvt-check ("navigators fixture economy: " & e) False
      is Ok (x) -> act
        v <- gv-new shard x
        items <- gsi-new shard.world
        founded <- bb-populate-at v items 0 bb-tinker (BbSpot { x = 1424, y = 1650, z = 0 })
        actor <- (list-at v.vendors 0).actor
        a <- bvt-check "a founded tinker holds a sextant and a spyglass lot, each art the one its use reads (UOAIX-53)" (is-ok founded & bb-has-good v actor (BbGoods { item = 42, graphic = #1057 }) 0 & bb-has-good v actor (BbGoods { item = 42, graphic = #14F5 }) 0 & gnv-sextant #1057 & gnv-spyglass #14F5)
        b <- bvt-check "an unlisted sextant art is held by no tinker lot" (is-ok founded & not (bb-has-good v actor (BbGoods { item = 42, graphic = #1058 }) 0))
        a + b
      end
